(7653497, 1245680, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!<br/> <br/>Well propped and composed!<br/> <br/>I''m not a fan of the tint for this challenge topic, but the rest... I love!</td>', 'What a great shot! Well propped and composed! I''m not a fan of the tint for this challenge topic, but the rest... I love!', '2020-02-13 18:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7653498, 1245720, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this so much!  <br/> <br/>She makes me feel so happy and young!<br/> <br/>If your score isn''t doing as well as you''d like, I think it''s the challenge topic.   I think this would score much better in a different challenge.<br/> <br/>Still... I love it.<br/> <br/>I''ve added it to my "favorites".<br/> <br/>Thank you.</td>', 'I love this so much!   She makes me feel so happy and young! If your score isn''t doing as well as you''d like, I think it''s the challenge topic.   I think this would score much better in a different challenge. Still... I love it. I''ve added it to my "favorites". Thank you.', '2020-02-13 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7653499, 1245542, 86447, '<td valign="top">I hope he finds it!<br/> <br/>You''ve done a really great job of making this believable. (Maybe a bit brighter highlights?)<br/> <br/>I hope your score is reflecting what a wonderful image this is.</td>', 'I hope he finds it! You''ve done a really great job of making this believable. (Maybe a bit brighter highlights?) I hope your score is reflecting what a wonderful image this is.', '2020-02-13 18:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7653500, 1245707, 86447, '<td valign="top">You almost always make me smile.<br/> <br/>Thanks for that.   :)</td>', 'You almost always make me smile. Thanks for that.   :)', '2020-02-13 18:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7653501, 1245658, 86447, '<td valign="top">So wonderfully done!<br/> <br/>One of my top picks.<br/> <br/>I do wish it were less red... more b/w or true sepia.  Everything else is perfection.</td>', 'So wonderfully done! One of my top picks. I do wish it were less red... more b/w or true sepia.  Everything else is perfection.', '2020-02-13 18:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7653502, 1245550, 86447, '<td valign="top">While I love the tones and the light, I find myself wanting more.<br/> <br/>"More what?" I asked myself.<br/> <br/>I think I want more drama... maybe shot from a higher angle?<br/> <br/>Or maybe more room to the left so the left vessel doesn''t seem so crowded?  Or... turn it into the frame so the viewer feels more comfortable with everything pointing to the center?<br/> <br/>Or... put the bell in the row, but on the total left of it all?  So they''re lined up in order of height?   I don''t know.<br/> <br/>I like this... but... I want more.<br/> <br/>You''ve done so well with the light and the details like the rippled cloth...</td>', 'While I love the tones and the light, I find myself wanting more. "More what?" I asked myself. I think I want more drama... maybe shot from a higher angle? Or maybe more room to the left so the left vessel doesn''t seem so crowded?  Or... turn it into the frame so the viewer feels more comfortable with everything pointing to the center? Or... put the bell in the row, but on the total left of it all?  So they''re lined up in order of height?   I don''t know. I like this... but... I want more. You''ve done so well with the light and the details like the rippled cloth...', '2020-02-13 18:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7653682, 1245684, 50289, '<td valign="top">I like the almost three dimensional look.</td>', 'I like the almost three dimensional look.', '2020-02-15 17:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
