(7653777, 1245658, 4008, '<td valign="top">You did your research!! Taking a portrait in those days was a big thing. People made sure they looked their best, dressing for the occasion. Your submission totally shows that and the execution was just perfect in my view.</td>', 'You did your research!! Taking a portrait in those days was a big thing. People made sure they looked their best, dressing for the occasion. Your submission totally shows that and the execution was just perfect in my view.', '2020-02-17 16:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
